A||||38||Fierochic88||Best Birthday Ever ||||10||
Z||000000||Fierochic88||08-25-2001||09:45 PM||||Well today I turned 21...and I must say that this was definitely the best birthday I ever had!  It started off with me getting some super cool custom made keys for my 88 GT from my very sweet boyfriend.  He even went all the way to Carlisle (2 hrs out of his way) to get them cut so I would have them for my birthday.  He really was paying attention when I said I wanted those while at GM Nationals!  <P>Then we went cruising around in his Fiero and listened to a neat CD he made especially for me!  Filled with very sweet music that reminds me of him!<P>Finally just after midnight, after finding my "lost" ID, we went to the bar and had a few drinks before coming home and heading to bed to get up bright and early to hit the junkyards this morning!<P>We got some cool goodies and even an AC Compressor for my coupe (Thanks Joey for all your help) and some neat scoops and stuff for my 85 GT and for FieroGT 914's 87.<P>After junkyarding we came home for the PA BBQ 2.  We had tons of Fieros and forum and non forum members.  84 Bill (& Family), SkiTime & Veronica'sGT, FieroGT 914 & TooMany Fieros (of course), HankisHere, FleabitDog, Perks86GT, and Snafus87 were among the many Fiero owners who made the appearance to enjoy some BBQ and celebrate my 21st with me!  We topped the evening off with taking 9 Fieros to the local cruise night.  We were the best represented car there!  <P>Oh and I even got a bottle of Martini Fiero.  I hear that's Cliff's favorite stuff!  It's named Fiero and it's alcoholic!  Oh and we also saw pictures of Cliff today!  So now we can pick him out of a lineup :-)<P>What a wonderful day!  And now I'm off to the BAR!!!! with my wonderful boyfriend!!  And tomorrow, off to Long Island to get another car!<P>Jennifer<P>------------------<BR>IM Username:  FieroChic88<BR>Silver 1988 GT<BR>Silver 1986 2m4<BR>Cobalt Blue 85 GT<P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/jenscar-sig1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
Z||000001||CoolBlue87GT||08-25-2001||09:50 PM||||Well Happy Birthday darling !!!<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jenscar.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 08-25-2001).]||||reg||4
Z||000002||kempo||08-25-2001||09:55 PM||||HAPPY BIRTHDAY JEN!!!<BR>\~/ \~/ \~/ \~/  &lt;--- Free Drinks for everyone!!!<P>-Kemp||||reg||10
