Z||000029||skitime||08-26-2001||08:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by firstfiero:<BR><B>        Happy birthday and all that good stuff!! Just waundering....I would love to come to one of these fiero bbq's but the problem is I have a very average car and every car I see is a perfect beautiful modded car. I love my car but I think I would be a little embarased.....   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey FirstFiero,  the BBQs are not a car show.  We don't care what your Fiero looks like and there are no awards.  We don't care if you can't even make it in your Fiero and drive another car. We just like meeting with others that love Fieros too. We just spent the day talking about Fieros, eating, working on Fieros, eating, talking about fieros eating and drove to a cruise, and  talked about Fiero. So you really have no excuse to not be at the next one.   <P><P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
